  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Hard Board Table_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2da076b6776cc384daa3ebf2b151408b, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 148505878528
    m_Localized: "<size=28>King Commands Holy Warrior to \u201CSubjugate the Remaining
      Dragons before the royal wedding.\u201D Warrior sets out on his journey today."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238656
    m_Localized: "Our Royal Highness commanded the Hero to defeat the three remaining
      dragons before the royal wedding. Though lieges and citizens voiced concern,
      the king maintained a firm stance: \u201CWe cannot predict when another Demon
      Lord might attempt to kidnap the princess. Remember the adage: those who strike
      first shall win.\u201D\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238657
    m_Localized: <size=28>[Current Affairs for Dummies] There's More Than One Dark
      Lord?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238658
    m_Localized: 'In the beginning, the dungeon split into four directions with the
      kingdom at its center. Four Dark Lords began their reign in the corresponding
      direction: the Red Dragon, the Blue Dragon, the White Dragon, and the Black
      Dragon. However, they either never emerged from the dungeons or abandoned their
      lairs, allowing the kingdom''s peace to endure...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238659
    m_Localized: '<size=28>Holy Warrior Announces New Wtube Content: Yesterday It
      Was Venturing, Today It''s Conquest'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238660
    m_Localized: "The Warrior announced new content through their personal Wtube
      channel. Titled \u201CConquering the Dark Lords\u201D, it will document the
      entire journey to defeat the three dragons. \u201CConquering the Dark Lords\u201D
      is scheduled to premiere on the Warrior's personal channel starting next week."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238661
    m_Localized: "<size=28>Even Lightning Shan\u2019t Block the Way! Conquering the
      Dark Lords, Ep. 1 \u201CThe Blue Dragon: The Second Dark Lord\u201D OUT NOW!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238662
    m_Localized: "By reasoning that at least one dragon would be inside the dungeon,
      the Holy Warrior headed for the sealed ancient dungeon. The dark lord waiting
      there was the Blue Dragon, whose legend states it wields lightning. Episode
      1 of Conquering the Dark Lords is now available on the Holy Warrior\u2019s
      channel."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238663
    m_Localized: " <size=28>\u2018Hero Defamation Charges\u2019 Fiend Receives Fine
      in First Trial; Hero and the Bootlickers Appea\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238664
    m_Localized: "The anonymous fiend, known as the uploader of the video titled
      This So Called Hero Is Scamming The Whole Kingdom was fined 3,000 dinars for
      defaming the hero. The Hero and the Bootlickers appealed, arguing the sentence
      was too lenient. The fiend claimed, \u201CThe very fact that the second demon
      king was defeated so quickly is a total fraud\u201D."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238665
    m_Localized: "<size=28>[Pictoria] \u201CEven the King Is Just a Doting Dad\u201D
      Royal Family Releases Private Footage\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238666
    m_Localized: "The Royal Family released private footage capturing the daily life
      of the King and Princess. The King, known for being a \u201Cdoting dad\u201D
      and \u201Cprincess\u2019s fool,\u201D beamed with joy throughout his time with
      the Princess. The Princess, showing familiarity with her father's affectionate
      demeanor, showcased the close bond among her family members."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238667
    m_Localized: "<size=28>Wake Me Up, When September Ends! Conquering the Dark Lords,
      Ep. 2 \u201CThe White Dragon: The Second Dark Lord\u201D OUT NOW"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238668
    m_Localized: "Based on sightings of the White Dragon appearing in cold regions,
      the Holy Warrior headed north. But along the way, surging ice spikes attack
      from nowhere! Episode 2 of Conquering the Dark Lords is now available on the
      Holy Warrior\u2019s channel."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238669
    m_Localized: "<size=28>King Unboxes Warrior's Tribute \u2018White Dragon Cloak\u2019...
      \u201CIt Highlights My Authority\u201D\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238670
    m_Localized: "The King released a video unboxing the White Dragon Cloak presented
      by the Hero. Wrapping himself in the cloak and parading around the castle,
      the King boasted, \u201CWonderful! How majestic am I?\u201D fully revealing
      his joy of heart.\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238671
    m_Localized: "<size=28>\u201CEven dragons are edible when fried\u201D Princess
      reveals special affection for fried dishes"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238672
    m_Localized: "At this public banquet, it was revealed the princess still enjoys
      fried cuisine. She previously stated in a royal channel video, \u201CEven dragons
      would taste good if fried. I would want my marriage partner to make some fried
      dishes for breakfast.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
